WEBVTT

00:29.018 --> 00:33.560
Shadows lengthen on the wall The sequence has

00:33.680 --> 00:38.382
begun A chill is blowing through the hall

00:39.563 --> 00:44.705
Awakening the sun We read the signs in broken

00:44.805 --> 00:51.188
glass And traced the hidden lines Another empty

00:51.228 --> 00:57.700
day will pass Another fate declines Your games

00:57.781 --> 01:03.346
are turning in the dark Above the factory floor

01:04.346 --> 01:08.770
We try to catch the fadding spark Behind the

01:08.971 --> 01:16.497
heavy dark Can you see the prophecy unfold? It's

01:16.658 --> 01:21.862
unfolding Shadows in the stories we were told

01:25.877 --> 01:26.538
A prophecy unfolds

01:46.724 --> 01:51.747
A thousand voices in the wire A whisper in the

01:51.867 --> 01:58.111
screen We feed the papers to the fire To keep the

01:58.271 --> 02:03.034
engine clean You lock the gate and turn the key

02:04.254 --> 02:09.557
You try to understand How anything was meant to

02:09.597 --> 02:16.416
be Inside this hololand Just to remain against

02:16.576 --> 02:22.497
the tide Against the bitter cold With nowhere

02:22.517 --> 02:29.460
left for us to hide Exactly as foretold Can you

02:29.540 --> 02:35.682
see the prophecy unfold? It's unfolding

02:36.102 --> 02:39.883
Shadows in stories we were told

02:43.177 --> 02:46.598
I turn the wheel and watch the cold hours run

02:50.140 --> 02:56.402
Hitting from the freezing of the sun A prophecy

02:56.682 --> 02:58.563
unfolds

03:04.525 --> 03:12.045
Is Irion in the code? At the ending of the road We

03:12.445 --> 03:17.027
are running out of time. We are running out of

03:17.107 --> 03:18.068
time.

03:45.977 --> 03:50.738
Can you see? The prophecy unfolds It's

03:50.878 --> 03:59.839
unfolding Shadows In the stories we were told

03:59.899 --> 04:03.280
Turn the wheel and watch the cold clouds run

04:06.841 --> 04:13.002
Hidden from the freezing of the sun A prophecy

04:13.302 --> 04:14.022
unfolds

04:16.702 --> 04:18.527
It's unfolding

